==French==

===Etymology===
{{af|fr|long|temps}}, from {{uder|fr|fro|lonc tans}}. Ultimately inherited from {{der|fr|ine-pro|*dlongʰos}}, whence also the English phrase {{cog|en|long time}}, the French term is a cognate, not a calque, of the English.

